---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AffiliateLink from "../../components/AffiliateLink.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Marvel's Spider-Man 2 — PS5 Buying Guide"
  description="A buying guide for Marvel's Spider-Man 2 on PS5: what's new, edition differences, and where to buy the digital version cheapest."
>
  <article class="post">
    <h1>Marvel's Spider-Man 2 — PS5 Buying Guide</h1>
    <p class="meta">PlayStation 5 · Updated 2026-08-05</p>

    <p>
      <strong>Marvel's Spider-Man 2</strong> is the PS5 exclusive that puts you in
      control of both Peter Parker and Miles Morales, swinging through a bigger,
      faster New York with the new Web Wings glide.
    </p>

    <h2>What's new</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Two playable Spider-Men with distinct power sets</li>
      <li>The Symbiote suit story arc and a larger open world</li>
      <li>Dual protagonists and faster traversal (Web Wings)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Standard vs Digital Deluxe</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Standard</strong> — the full game</li>
      <li><strong>Digital Deluxe</strong> — early unlock of 10 suits + a few points; cosmetic only</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Unless you want those suits on day one, Standard is the better value.</p>

    <h2>Where to buy cheapest (PS5)</h2>
    <p>
      As a PlayStation console exclusive, your options are the PlayStation Store and
      key resellers. A GMG PSN wallet-code or key can sometimes beat direct Store
      pricing, especially during site sales. Always compare the total against
      PlayStation Store wallet-credit promos before buying.
    </p>

    <h2>Where to buy</h2>
    <ul class="buy-list">
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="gmg"
          href="https://www.greenmangaming.com/search/?q=marvel+spiderman+2+ps5"
          cta="Check Green Man Gaming"
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="amazon"
          href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Marvels+Spider-Man+2+PS5"
          cta="Check on Amazon"
        />
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Prices change frequently — always verify on the store before purchasing.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post { padding: 1.5rem 0; max-width: 720px; }
  .post h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .buy-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
